    ],
    "note": "**Spicy** means having a strong taste from spices; spicy food may or may not burn your mouth. **Hot** about food can mean high in temperature or burning in taste, so *hot soup* can be unclear. To avoid confusion, people often say *spicy* for the burning taste."
